 "note": "Cape Naturaliste light station works yard, north-east of the keepers' cottages and reached from the car park loop, from the Landgate aerial (Oct 2026), OSM (ways 297320447, 297320452, 297320456) and the inHerit record: the 1940s store, shed and 1948 garage, timber-framed and clad in asbestos-cement sheet, round a sealed yard. A gabled shed (gable end to the north-north-east), a small near-flat-roofed store, and a long hipped garage, all with pale metal roofs. Back of house, seen across the trees from the car park's northern loop; it replaces the plain boxes the base builds from the OSM outlines. Metres: x left (east-south-east) to right (west-north-west) as seen from the north-north-east, y back.",
